Real bugs fixed (from scripts/ada/session-audit.py signatures):
- cctv_wall: action now defaults to 'start' (schema doesn't require it;
  positional-only signature raised TypeError on cctv_wall(zone=...) calls)
- set_facial_expression: out-of-enum expression returns a clear error
  instead of falling through to the runner as 'Unknown tool'
- home_status fast-path: valid what= with no HA/habit backend reports
  'unavailable' instead of the self-contradicting 'invalid what'
- get_home_state entity_id 404 -> 'no entity ... — home_search first'
- control_media_player: alias natural verbs (pause/play/stop/mute/...)
  onto the HA service names
- web_search: provider aliases google->gemini, ddg->duckduckgo; enum on
  the declaration
- devteam/decision_check/document_check/web_search: bump dead default
  gemini-2.5-flash -> gemini-3.5-flash-lite (repo convention; the old
  pin 404s — audit-fail devin_read)
- cms_get_page miss: return did_you_mean close-matches so slug guesses
  self-correct
- ada_enroll_speaker: drop who='guest' from the declared enum on
  non-CHABA_MEMORY instances (the path can never succeed there)

Companion chaba change (scripts/ada/session-audit.py) reclassifies
owner-gate denials -> acl and arg rejections -> usage, and collapses
same-day failure storms into one cluster card.

